        "nobel_worthiness": "Squeezed light provides a fundamental way to beat quantum measurement noise and has enabled more sensitive interferometry.",
        "attribution": "Caves framed the quantum limit and its evasion; Kimble's experiments and Schnabel's later work helped make squeezed-light interferometry practical.",
        "maturity": "The method is now used in gravitational-wave observatories and has been validated in demanding measurements.",
